    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like the struggle was the only thing keeping me going. now that the struggle is over, there's nothing left. it’s like i've finished the book and now i’m just sitting here waiting for the pages to run out. does it ever actually get better, or is it just a cycle of wanting things that don't matter until you eventually just run out of steam?",
